---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Watch — Greg O'Brien" description="Short videos on AI, product, and emerging technology, from my career as a product manager." current={1}>
<div data-screen-label="Watch archive">
<div data-hero="1" style="border-top:1px solid var(--edge);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);margin-top:38px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr">
<div data-hero-left="1" style="padding:96px 56px 84px;border-right:1px solid var(--rule)">
<div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">Watch</div>
<h1 style="margin:18px 0 0;font-family:Newsreader,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:54px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.02em">Things worth<br><span style="font-style:italic">explaining</span>.</h1>
</div>
<div data-hero-right="1" style="padding:calc(96px + 32.5px) 56px 84px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px">
<p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;max-width:46ch;color:var(--body)">Short videos on AI, product, and emerging technology. Reflections from my career as a product manager, kept short and practical.</p>
<div style="display:flex;gap:18px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted)"><span>3 planned</span><span>·</span><span>0 published</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="padding:40px 56px 14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline">
<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">First up</span>
<a href="/" style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s ease" class="h-ink">Home →</a>
</div>
<div data-cards="1" style="padding:14px 56px 44px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px">
<a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:block;border:1px solid var(--edge);grid-column:span 2;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);transition:border-color .2s ease" class="h-card">
<div style="aspect-ratio:16 / 9;background:var(--stripe);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:20px"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--muted)">[ VIDEO THUMBNAIL ]</span></div>
<div style="padding:18px 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--edge);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px">
<div><div style="font-family:Newsreader,serif;font-size:25px;line-height:1.25">"What actually makes something an agent?"<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:0.6em;color:var(--muted);vertical-align:0.28em;margin-left:0.4em">↗</span></div><p style="margin:9px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--body);max-width:70ch">A plain-language look at agents, autonomy, and where the hype gets ahead of the reality.</p></div>
<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap">AI · Product</span>
</div>
</a>
<a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:block;border:1px solid var(--edge);text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);transition:border-color .2s ease" class="h-card">
<div style="aspect-ratio:16 / 9;background:var(--stripe);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:20px"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--muted)">[ VIDEO THUMBNAIL ]</span></div>
<div style="padding:18px 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--edge)">
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px"><div style="font-family:Newsreader,serif;font-size:25px;line-height:1.25">"Why most AI pilots never ship"<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:0.6em;color:var(--muted);vertical-align:0.28em;margin-left:0.4em">↗</span></div><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap">AI · Product</span></div>
<p style="margin:7px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--body)">What actually kills AI projects before they reach production, and the decisions that move them forward instead.</p>
</div>
</a>
<a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:block;border:1px solid var(--edge);text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);transition:border-color .2s ease" class="h-card">
<div style="aspect-ratio:16 / 9;background:var(--stripe);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:20px"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--muted)">[ VIDEO THUMBNAIL ]</span></div>
<div style="padding:18px 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--edge)">
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px"><div style="font-family:Newsreader,serif;font-size:25px;line-height:1.25">"The product manager's guide to agentic AI"<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:0.6em;color:var(--muted);vertical-align:0.28em;margin-left:0.4em">↗</span></div><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap">Product · Career</span></div>
<p style="margin:7px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--body)">A practical look at where agents fit on a roadmap, without the hype.</p>
</div>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</Layout>
